# Project Plan — Known Issues and Deferred Work

This file is the canonical backlog. It is maintained by both human and AI contributors.

**Maintenance rules:**
- On every commit, check whether any item here was resolved and mark it `DONE`.
- When work is deferred mid-session (design decision, review finding, or scope split), add it here before closing.
- When a new issue is discovered (review, test failure, audit), add it here.
- Items marked `DONE` are kept for one week for traceability, then removed.
- Grade: **Impact** H/M/L × **Effort** H/M/L.

---

