### High impact, medium effort — next batch

**A12 — Arrival join hardcoded to DOWNWIND** — DONE (2026-04-23)
`PilotMission.joinLeg: Option<LegName>` stores the join leg from `JoinCircuit`.
`processInstruction(JoinCircuit)` maps `JoinType → LegName` via `toCircuitLeg()` (exhaustive).
`planRouteIfNeeded` dispatches to `buildVisualModeRoute` with `mission.joinLeg` for Visual mode.
Tests: `JoinCircuit stores joinLeg`, `JoinType.toCircuitLeg() exhaustive mapping`, join-leg route
start-point assertions in `PilotRoutePlannerTest`.
Impact: H | Effort: M

**A10 — ATC-instructed go-around not integration-tested** — DONE (2026-04-23)
Also fixed: `goAroundTask()` had `AWAITING_ATC_INSTRUCTION` (INSTRUCTION_GATED) which permanently
blocked the pilot after ATC-instructed go-around. VFR go-arounds are autonomous — removed that step.
`checkSelfInitiatedGoAround` simplified to use `goAroundTask()` directly (was duplicating it).
Test: `ATC-instructed go-around resets clearance and pilot eventually lands` — mission state
assertions (hasClearance reset, tree shape, no AWAITING_ATC_INSTRUCTION) + integration.
Impact: H | Effort: M

**C1 — `ReadbackCorrection` loses `AtomDefect` list** — DONE (2026-04-22)
`AtomDefect` moved to `protocol/PilotTransmission.kt`; `ReadbackVerdict.Incorrect.defects`
upgraded to `NonEmptyList<AtomDefect>`; `ReadbackCorrection.kind: ReadbackCorrectionKind`
now a derived extension; `defectsHaveWrongValue()` helper added to protocol.
Impact: H | Effort: M

**E3 — Clearance not driving `WaypointConstraints`** — DONE (2026-04-23)
`PilotMission.altitudeRestrictionM: Double?` added; `processInstruction(StopClimbAt)` stores
the level (via `levelToMeters`); reset to null in `resetForGoAround`. Visual-mode route planner
now continuous: re-derives route every tick from kinematic route head + mission state. Stability
check against `kinematicIntent.route` (not `aircraft.route`) prevents waypoint regression after
DefaultPilot pops waypoints. Suffix suppression prevents join-point regression. Go-around
bootstrap case (Final + FLY_DEPARTURE → `buildGoAroundRoute`) fixed. E3 test in `ArrivalRoutingTest`.
Impact: H | Effort: M

**D1 — Condition-space permutation tests departure-only** — DONE (2026-04-23)
`ArrivalConditionSpaceTest` added: 19 tests, 208 combinations across all 5 non-Complete arrival
stages (AwaitDownwind, AwaitApproach, LandingClearanceIssued, AwaitLandedObserved, AwaitVacating).
Structural properties: SAFETY priority, no ambiguous overlap, no blind spots, no action failures,
full coverage. Go-around interrupts (GA-PRE-CLEAR, GA-POST-CLEAR) verified. Ground reconciliation
already covered by GroundReconciliationTest.kt (134 lines).
Impact: H | Effort: M

