### Deferred findings from Phase B review

**PB-1 — `CircuitAfterGoAround` goal wrong after go-around phase** — DONE (2026-04-22)
`derivePilotGoal` for `CircuitAfterGoAround` now recurses into the active child:
GoAround subtask active → TOUCH_AND_GO; resumed Circuit subtask → ARRIVE.
Previously always returned TOUCH_AND_GO, causing no vacate instruction after landing.

**PB-2 — `isCircuitLike()` and `isLastActiveCircuit` filter used `||` chains** — DONE (2026-04-22)
Both converted to exhaustive `when` expressions so new TaskName variants require a conscious decision.

**PB-3 — `CircuitNotFound` error when circuit leg has empty points** — DONE (2026-04-22)
Changed to `InsufficientGeometry` (circuit exists, geometry data is incomplete).

---

### Deferred findings from Phase A review

**PA-1 — `OnCircuitLeg` missing `failureMessage` override**
Defaults to `"OnCircuitLeg"` which is unhelpful in training feedback traces.
Should be `"Aircraft is not on the ${leg.name} leg"`.
Impact: L | Effort: L

**PA-2 — Raw `Double` for distance in `WithinDistanceOfThreshold`**
Parameter `maxMetres: Double` should be a `Meters` value class to prevent unit confusion.
The `_M` suffix on `MAX_LANDING_CLEARANCE_DISTANCE_M` is a workaround.
Impact: M | Effort: L (pending Meters value class existence elsewhere)

**PA-3 — `§7.10.1` citation in `WithinDistanceOfThreshold` comment is not a real sub-section**
ICAO 4444 16th ed. §7.10 is not subdivided to §7.10.1. Comment-only, no implementation impact.
Impact: L | Effort: L

